==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|pathology|ical|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{lb|en|medicine}} Pertaining to [[pathology]].
# {{lb|en|medicine}} Relating to, amounting to, causing, or caused by a physical or mental disorder.
# {{lb|en|mathematics}} Having properties which are [[counterintuitive]] or difficult to handle.
# {{lb|en|computer science}} Having properties that cause unusually bad behaviour, especially regarding correctness or performance.

